      "id": "claim_b036632a0efd4721af457be0100074df",
      "statement": "ApprovalQueueImpl is a thin RpcTarget bound to one (gatekeeperId, caller) pair delegating to OverseerImpl; authorizeObservation enforces prohibitAllSharing (setting the lockdown flag on an unshared workspace, blocking when shared) and forward exclusion via excludeObservers (blocking while any named observer is still authorized), then records an observation-type ActionRecord with state approved — observations are audit entries, not approval gates.",
