    {
      "id": "claim_eda42355104648288870f0888717e0d2",
      "statement": "Auto-approval eligibility requires BOTH signals — the gatekeeper author's per-action autoApprovable verdict and a user-enabled rule for that action kind (autoApproveTags keyed gatekeeperId:tag); the drain is deferred via waitUntil because applying calls back into the gatekeeper facet still awaiting submitAction, and the AutoApprovalDrainer applies eligible pending actions in ascending id order with a per-gatekeeper single-flight guard (plus rerun flag) so concurrent drains cannot double-apply, re-checking eligibility immediately before each apply.",
